  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1700 had previously been adopted by Document #10136, effective 5-23-12, which had contained Part Saf-C 1701 through Part Saf-C 1713 pursuant to RSA 260:74 and RSA 26",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Chapter Saf-C 1700 had previously been adopted by Document #10136, effective 5-23-12, which had contained Part Saf-C 1701 through Part Saf-C 1713 pursuant to RSA 260:74 and RSA 260:75, when the rules were subject to RSA 541-A. RSA 260:74 and RSA 260:75 were subsequently repealed by 2019, 98:3, I and II, effective 6-21-19. Chapter Saf-C 1700 in Document #13379 then superseded the former Chapter Saf-C 1700 before the rules filed under Document #10136 could expire on 5-23-22.\n\nDocument #13379 extensively amended the rules filed in Document #10136 and replaced all prior filings affecting rules in the former Chapter Saf-C 1700. The prior filings included the following documents:\n\n#4606, eff 4-28-89\n\n#6023, INTERIM, eff 4-28-95\n\n#6056, eff 6-28-95, EXPIRED: 6-28-03\n\n#7946, eff 9-3-03, EXPIRED: 9-3-11\n\n#9996, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\n#10136, eff 5-23-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1700.html"
}
